*.snupkg

# Ignore documentation
Documentation/
*.md
!Docker-Combined-Services-README.md

# Ignore logs and temp files
*.log
*.tmp
*.temp
Temp/
temp/

# Ignore deployment files
Publish/
PublishTest/
MigrationBackup/

# Ignore database files
*.mdf
*.ldf

